    "created_at": "2025-11-23T15:47:39Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-11-23T15:47:39Z",
    "body": "What about making this error a subclass of `TypeError`, just like how [`QuotaExceededError`](https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/API/QuotaExceededError) was recently changed to be a subclass of `DOMException`? Subclassing allows for extra information to be included, which in this case is the fact that the error is produced by `releaseLock`.\n",
